 526970990_20260803055943214965.png
DESCRIPTION:The energy is building\, the movement is growing\, the enthusi
 asm for Randy Villegas for Congress is palpable. Come be a part it. Join u
 s on Thursday evenings to call voters in California's 22nd Congressional D
 istrict to flip this Central Valley district blue and to elect the dedicat
 ed progressive representative CA-22 deserves. All welcome. No experience n
 eeded. Our hosts are ready to train and support you whether this is your f
 irst call or your thousandth.
LOCATION:Virtual event
