DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T193000
UID:68038e1043b436d2b0a768ec2183d3b0@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/RVGen_20260731172103972190.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Join the Villegas for Congress team for our Thursday phonebank
 s. We'll be calling voters in District 22 to earn their votes for the Nove
 mber 3rd election. Each phone bank will begin with a training on how to us
 e our phonebanking system and to review our script. If you have never phon
 ebanked before that’s okay\, we'll make sure you’re comfortable with e
 verything before we start calling. Please join us and bring a friend! Úne
 te al equipo de campaña de Villegas para el Congreso en nuestras sesiones
  
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/randyvillegas/event/1001388/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
